  "description": "**As a** Shopper, \n**I want** to land on a homepage that presents Zimmermann's seasonal campaigns, featured products, and editorial content in a structured and visually engaging layout, \n**so that** I can discover new collections, explore the brand, and navigate easily to the products and content I care about.\n\n----\n\nThe homepage is composed of the following content modules, in sequence from top to bottom:\n\n1. **Full-width hero banner** — A full-bleed image at the top of the page with headline text and a CTA link. Supports full-bleed or padded variants per design.\n1. **Featured product tiles row** — A row of 4 product tiles surfacing featured or new-arrival products, each linking to the relevant PDP.\n1. **Campaign/editorial image links row** — A row of images linking to edits, campaigns, or editorial landing pages.\n1. **Shop the Look hero** — A large-format hero image with a \"Shop the Look\" module positioned to the right, allowing the shopper to explore and navigate to featured products from the look.\n1. **Top categories row** — A row of category tiles, each with a campaign image, linking to the relevant category PLP.\n1. **Editorial and/or boutique duo** — A final row containing two equal-width (for desktop) hero images side by side: one linking to an editorial destination and one linking to the boutiques page or store locator.\n\n\n\nThis component can be built with mock content prior to Contentful content model being finalised.",
