      "body": "Removes 2 acceptance criteria from this user story because we can’t yet test that in the BM user story - this will need to be tested in the front-end user story which is [SFCC-132](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-132) (those Acceptance criteria are already in there).\n1. Given a badge has locale-specific label translations configured, when a shopper views the PDP in a non-English locale, then the translated badge label is displayed. (will be tested as part of the UI story - SFCC-\n1. Given a product is assigned to a badge category that is configured as region-specific (e.g. AU only), when a shopper views the PDP on a different storefront (e.g. US), then the badge is not displayed.\nFYI User:712020:4ec4770e-9470-4885-9753-69a36b6cf950",
